{
  "john.20.p1.b1": {
    "text": "Early on the first day of the week, while it was still dark,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p1.b2": {
    "text": "Mary Magdalene went to the tomb and saw that the stone had been removed from the entrance.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p1.b3": {
    "text": "They have taken the Lord out of the tomb, … and we do not know where they have put Him!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p2.b1": {
    "text": "Then Peter and the other disciple set out for the tomb.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p2.b2": {
    "text": "The two were running together, but the other disciple outran Peter and reached the tomb first.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p2.b3": {
    "text": "He bent down and looked in at the linen cloths lying there, but he did not go in.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p3.b1": {
    "text": "Simon Peter arrived just after him. He entered the tomb",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p3.b2": {
    "text": "The cloth that had been around Jesus’ head was rolled up, lying separate from the linen cloths.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p3.b3": {
    "text": "Then the other disciple, who had reached the tomb first, also went in. And he saw and believed.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p4.b1": {
    "text": "For they still did not understand from the Scripture that Jesus had to rise from the dead.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p4.b2": {
    "text": "Then the disciples returned to their homes.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p4.b3": {
    "text": "But Mary stood outside the tomb weeping.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p4.b4": {
    "text": "And as she wept, she bent down to look into the tomb,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p5.b1": {
    "text": "and she saw two angels in white sitting where the body of Jesus had lain, one at the head and the other at the feet.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p5.b2": {
    "text": "Woman, why are you weeping?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p5.b3": {
    "text": "Because they have taken my Lord away, … and I do not know where they have put Him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p6.b1": {
    "text": "When she had said this, she turned around and saw Jesus standing there; but she did not recognize that it was Jesus.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p6.b2": {
    "text": "Woman, why are you weeping? … Whom are you seeking?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p6.b3": {
    "text": "Thinking He was the gardener,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p6.b4": {
    "text": "Sir, if you have carried Him off, tell me where you have put Him, and I will get Him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p7.b1": {
    "text": "Mary.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p7.b2": {
    "text": "Rabboni!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p7.b3": {
    "text": "(which means “Teacher”).",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p8.b1": {
    "text": "Do not cling to Me, … for I have not yet ascended to the Father.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p8.b2": {
    "text": "But go and tell My brothers, ‘I am ascending to My Father and your Father, to My God and your God.’",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p8.b3": {
    "text": "I have seen the Lord!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p8.b4": {
    "text": "And she told them what He had said to her.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p9.b1": {
    "text": "It was the first day of the week, and that very evening, while the disciples were together with the doors locked for fear of the Jews,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p9.b2": {
    "text": "Jesus came and stood among them.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p9.b3": {
    "text": "Peace be with you!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p9.b4": {
    "text": "After He had said this, He showed them His hands and His side. The disciples rejoiced when they saw the Lord.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p10.b1": {
    "text": "Peace be with you. As the Father has sent Me, so also I am sending you.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p10.b2": {
    "text": "Receive the Holy Spirit.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p10.b3": {
    "text": "If you forgive anyone his sins, they are forgiven; if you withhold forgiveness from anyone, it is withheld.”",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p11.b1": {
    "text": "Now Thomas called Didymus, one of the Twelve, was not with the disciples when Jesus came.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p11.b2": {
    "text": "We have seen the Lord!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p11.b3": {
    "text": "Unless I see the nail marks in His hands, and put my finger where the nails have been, and put my hand into His side, I will never believe.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p12.b1": {
    "text": "Eight days later, His disciples were once again inside with the doors locked, and Thomas was with them.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p12.b2": {
    "text": "Peace be with you.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p12.b3": {
    "text": "Put your finger here and look at My hands. Reach out your hand and put it into My side.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p12.b4": {
    "text": "Stop doubting and believe.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p13.b1": {
    "text": "My Lord and my God!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p13.b2": {
    "text": "Because you have seen Me, you have believed;",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p13.b3": {
    "text": "blessed are those who have not seen and yet have believed.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p14.b1": {
    "text": "Jesus performed many other signs in the presence of His disciples, which are not written in this book.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p14.b2": {
    "text": "But these are written so that you may believe that Jesus is the Christ, the Son of God,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.20.p14.b3": {
    "text": "and that by believing you may have life in His name.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "John 20:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
